  # ------------------------------------------------------ rhyme knowledge
  rhyme_coverage
    rhyme_languages en
    gap "The registered wiktionary source (data/seed/sources-registry.lino) serves its Free Dictionary API for the language api_language leads with (en), and its per-language MediaWiki extracts endpoint carries no pronunciation field, so offline rhyme classes are grounded for en only; for ru/hi/zh/es this answer states the gap instead of guessing rhymes and composes unrhymed verse under the line-count and topic constraints."
  rhyme_class
    id iː
    word sea
    word free
    word tree
    word three
    word be
    word we
